<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/24/msa@/~cl_33__para_a__subpara_vi> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (2C) subperenggan yang berikut: \"(2D) In assessing the market value of any scheduled land which is an estate land, or forms part of an estate land within the meaning of section 214A of the National Act 56/65. Land Code, the market value shall not in any way be affected by the fact that it can be sold to one person.\"; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/24/msa@> .
